OL,3,CSchool uniform swap shop saving
OL,4,Cparents 'huge cost'
OL,6,FSummer is nearly over and the new
OL,7,Fschool term is just around the corner.
OL,9,FHowever, the cost of children going
OL,10,Fback to the classroom is putting many
OL,11,Fparents under financial pressure.JNew
OL,12,Funiforms, shoes, gym gear and
OL,13,Fstationary all come with a price tag.
OL,15,FPrimary school parents are expected to
OL,16,Fspend a total of #1,363 across the
OL,17,Fschool year.
OL,19,FIt is even costlier for secondary
OL,20,Fschool parents, who are expected to
OL,21,Fspend #2,029 across the school year.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/8
