PN,41702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1787089698
OL,3,CSchool uniform swap shop saving
OL,4,Cparents 'huge cost'
OL,6,FThe figures are according to new
OL,7,Fresearch from the Irish League of
OL,8,FCredit Unions.
OL,10,FNew legislation has tasked schools
OL,11,Fwith helping parents and guardians
OL,12,Flower the costs of uniforms.
OL,14,FThe School Uniforms (Guidelines and
OL,15,FAllowances) Bill was given royal
OL,16,Fassent in February 2026.
OL,18,FSelling pre-loved items like blazers,
OL,19,Fshirts, and skirts has been an
OL,20,Fapproach taken by a Co Armagh school.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
