PN,41703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1787089698
OL,3,CSchool uniform swap shop saving
OL,4,Cparents 'huge cost'
OL,6,FA swap shop at Lurgan Junior High
OL,7,FSchool (LJHS) is proving as a
OL,8,Ffinancial lifeline.
OL,10,FParent Aneka Woronko described
OL,11,Funiforms as a "huge cost".
OL,13,F"The shirts, trousers, shoes, and all
OL,14,Fof the equipment, all together, it's
OL,15,Fvery expensive.
OL,17,F"The price gap between the store and
OL,18,Fhere (swap shop) is huge, and this is
OL,19,Fvery handy for people."
OL,26,@zD@FpmzD@Ppn
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/8
