PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1787089698
OL,3,CSchool uniform swap shop saving
OL,4,Cparents 'huge cost'
OL,6,FVice-Principal at LJHS, Michael
OL,7,FThompson said the school has taken
OL,8,Fsteps to help families "save some
OL,9,Fmoney".
OL,11,FMr Thompson said: "We work very
OL,12,Fclosely with our feeder schools and
OL,13,Four local senior schools so that we
OL,14,Fare producing a uniform that's very
OL,15,Faffordable.
OL,17,F"We have removed some of the branded
OL,18,Fkit from PE. We've removed some of the
OL,19,Fbranded material.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1787089698
OL,3,CSchool uniform swap shop saving
OL,4,Cparents 'huge cost'
OL,6,F"We've kept everything as uniform as
OL,7,Fwe can, so that if you are going from
OL,8,Four school to another school, you can
OL,9,Fstill continue to wear the same items
OL,10,Fof uniform including the PE uniform."
OL,12,FA new survey conducted on behalf of
OL,13,Fthe Irish League of Credit Unions
OL,14,Fshowed 71% of parents said covering
OL,15,Fback-to-school costs is a financial
OL,16,Fburden.
OL,18,FAlmost two in five parents are getting
OL,19,Finto debt because of the costs.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
