PN,41706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1787089698
OL,3,CSchool uniform swap shop saving
OL,4,Cparents 'huge cost'
OL,6,FThe research carried out across
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland, surveyed 560 parents
OL,8,Fof children returning to or starting
OL,9,Fprimary or secondary school in
OL,10,FSeptember 2026.
OL,12,FMartin Fisher from the Irish League of
OL,13,FCredit Unions: "I think the more we
OL,14,Fcan move towards non-branded items,
OL,15,Fmore generic items, more items that
OL,16,Fare available from as many shops as
OL,17,Fpossible, then we will be in a better
OL,18,Fposition for parents.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1787089698
OL,3,CSchool uniform swap shop saving
OL,4,Cparents 'huge cost'
OL,6,F"The key role now is making sure
OL,7,Fparents do have that access to the non-
OL,8,Fbranded and the generic items as fast
OL,9,Fas possible."
OL,11,FThe Education Minister said schools
OL,12,Fwhich do not comply with the new
OL,13,Flegislation will have to explain why.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
