PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1787089698
OL,3,CSchool uniform swap shop saving
OL,4,Cparents 'huge cost'
OL,6,FPaul Givan said: "If it shows that a
OL,7,Fschool hasn't been following the
OL,8,Flegislation, we now have the ability
OL,9,Fto engage with that school to say that
OL,10,F'you're not in compliance with the
OL,11,Flegislation', and 'you need to now
OL,12,Fmake changes', and we can issue a
OL,13,Fdirection if that is necessary."
